# Battle against Tapu Lele (Akala's guardian, psychic): the guardians' tom pattern and horn call, then a playful,
# slightly eerie C-major-pentatonic flute tune that leans on three-three-two, with a celesta circling in threes and a
# whispering choir. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Tapu Lele
tempo 160
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.09
reverb 0.38

track lead flute lowhp=sawlead vol=0.8 pan=0 rev=0.34
  r1 | r1 |
  L o5 g4. e4. c4 | o5 a4. o6 c4. e4 | o6 d4. o5 a4. g4 | o5 a8 g8 d8 g8 a2 |
  o5 e4. g4. o6 c4 | o6 e4. d4. c4 | o6 c8 d8 e8 g8 a4 g8 e8 | o6 d2 o5 a4 g4 |
  o6 a4. g4. e4 | o6 g4. e4. c4 | o6 d8 e8 d8 o5 a8 g4 a4 | o6 c4. o5 g4. e4 |
  o5 a8 o6 c8 e8 a8 g8 e8 d8 c8 | o6 d4. a4. g4 | r4 o6 g8 e8 r4 g8 e8 | r4 o6 a8 g8 r4 e8 d8 |

# The guardians' horn call: the tonic, a leap to the fifth, the pentatonic step above it and back, then the tonic an octave up
track horn horn vol=0.5 pan=-0.2 rev=0.34
  o4 c8 g4. a8 g8 o5 c4 | o5 c2. r4 |
  L r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 |
  r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | o4 c8 g4. a8 g8 o5 c4 | o5 c2. r4 |

